  "notes": "The 8-grade primary school (általános iskola) has a lower section (grades 1–4) and an upper section (5–8). Secondary runs grades 9–12; six- and eight-year gimnázium start at grade 7 or 5, a language-preparatory year can be added, and technikum lasts five years."
